# CQ 12: Which action lines belong to no action path?
#
# Entry 351-44-04 has an action path composed of action lines. A line outside
# every path connects two functional units without taking part in the chain a
# control runs over, so nothing reaches it and it reaches nothing.
#
# The two units are reported alongside, since that is what identifies the line:
# a line has no name of its own in the standard, it is the connection from one
# unit to another.
#
# Empty on the three cases, which is the intended state.
PREFIX iec60050: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#>
SELECT ?line ?from ?to ?variable
WHERE {
  ?line a iec60050:ActionLine .
  OPTIONAL { ?line iec60050:fromUnit ?from }
  OPTIONAL { ?line iec60050:toUnit   ?to }
  OPTIONAL { ?line iec60050:carriesVariable ?variable }
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?line iec60050:partOfActionPath ?any }
} ORDER BY ?line
